======================================================================
ARM 2 -- anomaly BEFORE onset: a PRECURSOR, true causal fraction 0
======================================================================
A precursor cannot be caused by the event that follows it. If R were
a causal fraction it would return ~0 here for every f. If R measures
temporal CONCENTRATION it will return the same ~0.8 as arm 1.

  [measuring R at lag window (-30, -16)]
